  "ownsLevel": {
    "confidence": "verified",
    "items": [
      "Each rung's level sits on its 1H template, which also carries the name; the 2H template takes `Stats` and `BaseData` from it, but the archer template (`EncDraugr0NTemplateMissile`) takes only `BaseData` and keeps its own level: a rung change has to be made on the 1H and archer templates both. Every male and female head leaf takes `Stats` from one of them.",
      "Changing `EncDraugr01Template` 03B547 also needs `ccBGSSSE060_Ulfnir` 00081E:ccbgssse060-ba_dragonscale.esl (Ulfnir Bone-Skin, PC×1 [15–50]; on *Common Skeletons*): it uses 03B547 as its template but not for `Stats`. The CC zombie rungs `ccBGSSSE003EncZombie02`–`06Body{A,B,C}` and their `_Summon` copies (levels 3–40; on *Zombies (CC)*) also look like it: their `…Zombie01Body*` base takes `Stats` from the draugr leaf `EncDraugr01Melee1HHeadM00` 05593B, but they use it without `Stats`.",
      "Changing `EncDraugr02Template` 03B548, `EncDraugr03Template` 03B549 or `EncDraugr04Template` 03B54A also needs `EncDraugr02TemplateMagic` 038A25 · `…03…` 038A26 · `…04…` 038A27 (levels 6 · 13 · 21; on *Draugr Warlock*): they use the rung template but not for `Stats`.",
      "Six wrappers take their template from a draugr list or wrapper without `Stats`, so they stay at their own level 1 whatever rung they draw: `dunHighGateAnskaDraugr` 0B3199 (from `LCharDraugrMelee1HMale`), the three Folgunthur thralls (a row), and the Kolbjorn `DLC2dunKolbjorn_LvlDraugrMelee1HDefenderFemaleWeak` 03A428 · `…MissileMaleHoldPosition512Weak` 03A429 (Dragonborn.esm). The Sigdis duplicates do the same. The Folgunthur warlock is on *Draugr Warlock*.",
      "Every other draugr record (the ebony melee leaves, the Hulking variants, the `TreasCorpseDraugr*` corpses and every other `LvlDraugr*` wrapper, the Reachwater Rock thralls included) carries `Stats` and follows its template or list; besides the records above, only the `E3Demo` test copies do not."
    ]
  },
